    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. the purplish tint you mentioned is interesting, i'll keep an eye out for that. do you have any tips on how to apply the fertilizer so it actually gets into the soil instead of just sitting on top? i'm worried about it being wasted or something.",
